# Architecture — Feature Modules

## Project layout (no `src/` — flat root)

```
app/              Next.js App Router — (app)/ dashboard, (auth)/ login, Route Handlers
providers/        AppProviders, AppShell (Theme, Auth, Query, Toast)
config/           Re-export env, data-source, nav (logic stays in lib/)
components/       ui/, shared/, layout/, views/, auth/
views/            route screen components
features/         domain modules (he-thong/, _template/)
lib/              query/, db/, text/, validation/, factories/, view-types/, data-types/
server/           Hono + Prisma
prisma/           schema
store/            global Zustand (auth, app-wide)
hooks/            cross-cutting hooks
docs/             architecture, design-system, business-foundation, …
mocks/            dev mock data (NEXT_PUBLIC_DATA_SOURCE=mock)
```

New modules: copy `features/_template/` — see `docs/checklist-module.md`, `docs/business-foundation.md`.
Do not put business components in `components/shared`. Nav is config-only (`docs/navigation.md`).

## Feature module structure

```
features/<domain>/<entity>/
  core/
    types.ts
    schema.ts          ← Zod
    constants.ts
  components/          ← *-toolbar.tsx, *-form.tsx, *-detail.tsx, *-table.tsx
  hooks/               ← useQuery/useMutation wrappers
  store/               ← Zustand UI state
  services/            ← API/Prisma or mock calls
  utils/               ← pure helpers
  *-field-meta.ts      ← field → DataTypeId mapping (optional)
```

Structure by **feature/domain**, never by file type at repo root.

## View types & data types

- **ViewTypeId** (table, form, detail, dashboard…): `lib/view-types/` — layout & screen flow
- **DataTypeId** (text, date, ref…): `lib/data-types/` — form widgets & cell format
- Import primitives: `import { GenericTable, GenericDrawer, RhfDataField } from '@/components/views'`
- New modules: prefer `createFeatureModule` / `createFlatListFeatureModule` from `lib/` when CRUD list + stats fits

## Imports

- Always `@/*` path alias — **never** `../../*` cross-folder
- Feature-internal relative imports are OK within the same feature folder
- Tree-shake: import from `@/components/views` or specific files, not barrel re-exports of entire app

## Component rules

- Functional components only; no default `React` import
- Components render UI; business logic in hooks or services
- Target ≤150 lines per component, ≤30 lines per function — extract when larger
- Permission checks: `can()` / `<Can>` from permissions hooks — see `features/he-thong/phan-quyen/`

## Naming

- Files: kebab-case (`nhan-vien-form.tsx`, `use-nhan-vien.ts`)
- Components: PascalCase matching file purpose (`NhanVienForm`)
- Hooks: `use` prefix (`useEmployees`, `useCreateEmployee`)
- Vietnamese UI strings: keys in `lib/text` via `txt()` — not hardcoded in new code

## Docs before inventing patterns

- UI conventions: `docs/UI-CONVENTIONS.md`
- View catalog: `docs/view-types.md`
- Cursor rules: `.cursor/rules/06-project-5f.mdc` for dialog/drawer/toolbar specifics

## Scope discipline

- Minimal diff — do not refactor unrelated modules
- Match existing patterns in `features/he-thong/` when adding new entities
- No new dependencies without justification aligned with `01-core-stack.mdc`
